    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Auto reset macro for mu online.

Steps:

1. Three clients in win mode.
2. A ingame macro, use in chat "/reset" then enter after the reset it automatically Press "Home" if your server have MU helper NOTE: You can delete the Home Button if your server doesn't have MU Helper
3. Enjoy.

Game Settings

Window mode = 1
Resolution 800x600
Mouse Sensitivity 3

You can use C# or Python for Level detector it will automatically Launch the macro once it was detected level 400 

Macro Timings
Delays 100ms

Home Button = 11 minutes you can change it depends on where you level fast 
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download |</Comment>
